commit 4d442ab4d1a68f9f1d93783ebac7e8c2e4d0dd0a
Author: Christoph Kieslich <c.kieslich@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 09:12:48 2026 +0100

    R2 01: AI processing setting and the OpenRouter client (#112)

    - Organization setting aiProcessing (migration 0011, off by default),
      Organization admin only, with a Settings panel that says what is sent,
      to whom, and that nothing is kept. PATCH /organization fields are now
      each optional.
    - AiClient (domain) with a typed AiInput that admits only redacted text,
      Question text, scores and changes; no ids, names, or times.
    - OpenRouter adapter sending exactly ADR 0015's body (Claude Haiku 5.5,
      zdr, EU endpoints only, no fallback, data_collection deny, strict JSON
      schema). 60 s timeout, retries on 408/429/502/503 honouring Retry-After
      (capped), bodies never read on error and cancelled, nothing logged.
      Missing key fails closed with AiNotConfigured.
    - OPENROUTER_API_KEY bound from the deploying environment.
    - When AI processing is on, the answer page and the Invitation and
      Reminder emails tell members (stored sends without the flag read as off).

    Closes #102


    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M727APMGZGZ5HAZH1BCHH105

    Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

